---
layout: default
subject: "[{{base_id_tag}}] Security alert: {{event}}"
---
<p style="font-size: 16px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 20px 0;"><strong>Security alert</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
	A security-relevant event was recorded on your {{instance_name}} instance.
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px;">
	<tr>
		<td style="padding: 15px 20px;">
			<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Event:</strong> {{event}} ({{outcome}})</p>
			<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Category:</strong> {{category}}</p>
			<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Time:</strong> {{time}}</p>
			{{#if tnId}}<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Tenant:</strong> {{tnId}}</p>{{/if}}
			{{#if actor}}<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Actor:</strong> {{actor}}</p>{{/if}}
			{{#if ip}}<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>IP:</strong> {{ip}}</p>{{/if}}
			{{#if failures}}<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Failed logins in the last 15 minutes:</strong> {{failures}}</p>{{/if}}
			{{#if details}}<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0;"><strong>Details:</strong> <code>{{details}}</code></p>{{/if}}
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
	Review the audit log for the full history. Further alerts of this type are
	held back for 15 minutes.
</p>
